# The docs content collection is authored Markdown/MDX, not code, so oxfmt does
# not format it. It lives here after moving from a repo-root /docs directory
# that oxfmt never reached (it was a symlink; oxfmt does not follow directory
# symlinks). oxfmt reads this file only via --ignore-path, which the format
# scripts in package.json pass.
src/content/docs/
